    <string name="targets_play_mode_help">For Play services, its framework and the Play Store. Generate is recommended, as TEESimulator-RS documents: Play Integrity then always gets a key attested with the keybox.</string>
    <string name="targets_mode_help">Automatic patches the certificates of the device\'s own keystore when it works, and generates keys otherwise. Generate always generates keys from the keybox; Patch always patches.</string>
