    <string name="settings_credits_short">TEESimulator-RS, Play Integrity Fork, AlwaysStrong</string>
    <string name="settings_credits_text">Replay Integrity drives TEESimulator-RS (Enginex0, JingMatrix) and Play Integrity Fork (osm0sis, chiteroman), and uses the keybox and fingerprint sources of AlwaysStrong (Evokerr). It works with Shizuku and Sui (RikkaApps).</string>
    <string name="settings_uninstall">When Replay Integrity is uninstalled, its boot hook removes itself at the next boot. The files of the modules (keybox.xml, target.txt, security_patch.txt, custom.pif.prop) are kept, so that the modules keep working.</string>
